      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i am getting a 402 error when trying to hit the stripe api for a checkout session. the card is definitely valid and has funds. what are some common reasons this happens and how should i check my request payload to make sure i'm not missing something?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
